    <h1>About Mondeclat</h1>
    <p>Welcome to <strong>Mondeclat</strong> — a modern lifestyle journal covering the four subjects that quietly shape a well-considered life: fashion, beauty, lifestyle, and technology.</p>
    <p>We write for readers who think about what they buy, what they wear, and how they spend their time. Every article on Mondeclat is original, edited, and intended to be useful — whether that means explaining why a fabric drapes the way it does, walking through a five-minute skincare routine that actually works, or helping you choose a smart-home device you will not regret a year later.</p>
    <p>Our editorial team is small, our pace is calm, and our commitment is to clarity. We are not interested in hype cycles or daily news; we are interested in ideas worth returning to.</p>
    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left:1.4rem;line-height:1.85">
      <li><strong>Fashion</strong> — silhouettes, fabrics, independent designers, and the pieces worth investing in.</li>
      <li><strong>Beauty</strong> — skincare routines backed by dermatologists, fragrance layering, and ingredient literacy.</li>
      <li><strong>Lifestyle</strong> — morning rituals, hosting, slow living, and small-space design.</li>
      <li><strong>Technology</strong> — productivity tools, smart home, wearables, and how to keep digital life humane.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Have a tip, partnership idea, or a piece you would like us to consider? Reach us via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
